        },
        {
            id: "walk_away",
            title: "Walk-Away Safe",
            icon: "arcforge:freeze_plug",
            description: [
                "Let a salt core overheat and watch the Freeze Plug do its job: the salt drains into the tank and the core shuts itself down. It refreezes once it's powered and cool again."
